DS_RESULTS LIST DESCRIPTION and RULES
-------------------------------------

The DS_Results list is an unmoderated list for patients who have undergone th=
e=20
duodenal switch (BPD/DS, DGB/DS, LG/DS, etc.) obesity surgery procedure and a=
re=20
at least 6 months post-op.

This list is a place for us to post milestones, updates and status reports. T=
he=20
goal is to build an archive where people who are researching the Duodenal=20
Switch procedure can look to get a sense of how we're faring over the long-te=
rm=20
after our surgery, including positives and negatives, both physical and=20
emotional.

Posting is restricted to DS post-ops who are 6 months and beyond.=20

Everyone is welcome to join, but please do not post to the list unless you ar=
e=20
a DS patient at least 6 months post-op. This rule will allow archive readers =
to=20
get a realistic sense of our overall experience beyond the initial recovery a=
nd=20
adjustment to post-op life.=20

This is not the place to discuss immediate post-op recovery issues. For=20
discussion including early post-op problems, see the DS_PostOp_Problems list =

at the following URL:=20

http://groups.yahoo.com/group/DS_PostOp_Problems/join=20

For general open discussion, please join the main DS list at the following UR=
L:=20

http://groups.yahoo.com/group/duodenalswitch/join





